## Interface: 16001
## Title: Glide
## Notes: Glide - records quests, NPCs, XP and routes, and streams live game state to the Glide companion through a small pixel strip (top-left). What it does for you: repairs everything at a merchant who repairs, and when the bags are full, deletes the cheapest item RestedXP marked as junk.
